{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>To go to the land of Canaan.</b> For it was disposed toward the attainment of perfections in the intellect, and was chosen above all lands, as it says: אֶרֶץ אֲשֶׁר ה' אֱלֹהֶיךָ דּוֹרֵשׁ אוֹתָהּ (Deuteronomy 11:12). Its air was not corrupted by the waters of the Flood as was the air of all other lands, as it says: לֹא גֻשְׁמָה בְּיוֹם זָעַם (Ezekiel 22:24). And our Sages, of blessed memory, already said: the air of the Land of Israel makes wise (Bava Batra 58b)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:50.299771185Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}